    scatterlist: Add P2P flag to ensure SGLs are homogeneously P2P or not
    =

    Introduce sg_init_p2p_table() which creates an SGL with a special P2P
    flag set. Then BUG_ON in sg_assign_page if a developer tries to assign
    a P2P page to a non-p2p SGL and vice-versa.
    =

